S plugin updates are pending (@RibatTRW)\r\n- EPUB parser no longer includes novel title in chapter title (@mrissaoussama)\r\n- Fix extension restoring from cold state (@mrissaoussama)\r\n- Fix manga custom metadata reset on refresh (@mrissaoussama)\r\n- Font family selector dialog is now scrollable and long font names no longer squash the setting label \r\n- Fix novel reader crash when opening a chapter on Android 8.0/8.1 (@RibatTRW)\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-->\r\n\r\n> [!TIP]\r\n>\r\n> ### If you are unsure which version to download then go with `tsundoku-v0.3.4.apk`\r\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tsundoku-otaku/tsundoku/releases/415236039/reactions", "total_count": 3, "+1": 2, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 1}, "mentions_count": 3}}